# Return with auto-indent, and Options > Editor > Trim Auto-indent on: the
# indent Return left on a line goes when the cursor leaves the line without
# anything typed on it, in the same Ctrl-U as the key. A line the user typed
# on keeps its indent.
file t.c
seed b"    int a = 1;\n"
rc "[General]\nOptions2 : 2200\n"
end
enter
type b"b"
enter
enter
up
down
